# Product shots for the sign-in page showcase.
#
# Drop two files in this folder and they appear automatically — no code change:
#
#   web.png     the dashboard in a browser   (16:10 works best, e.g. 1440x900)
#   phone.png   the app on Android           (tall/portrait, e.g. 1080x2160)
#
# Until they exist, AppShowcase renders a styled empty device frame instead,
# so the page never shows a broken image.
#
# Rendered by: src/components/auth/AppShowcase.jsx
